---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h1>About Ivanya</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to Ivanya, where tradition meets contemporary style. Our journey began with a simple passion: to create beautiful, handcrafted ethnic wear that resonates with the modern woman. Each piece in our collection is a labor of love, designed in-house and brought to life by skilled artisans.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe in conscious fashion—using high-quality, breathable fabrics and timeless designs that you can cherish for years to come. Our aesthetic is rooted in minimal elegance, celebrating the rich heritage of Indian textiles with a fresh, stylish perspective. Thank you for being a part of our story.
      </p>
      </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-content {
    max-width: 750px; /* Constrains the width for better readability */
    margin: 0 auto; /* Centers the content block */
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-content img {
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
</style>